<title>UK: Royal Bank of Scotland H1 pretax profit up.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank of Scotland H1 pretax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  24.3		 vs 21.3</p>
<p> Dividend  (pence)	  6.2		  vs 5.4</p>
<p> Pretax			 369		  vs 301</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-excepts	419		  vs 346</p>
<p> Total debt provision     78		   vs 45</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 345.0 and 383.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Royal Bank of Scotland</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7719</p>
